<title>HONG KONG: ABN Amro HK branch places HK$50 mln CD.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro HK branch places HK$50 mln CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN Amro Bank's Hong Kong branch has lodged a HK$50 million fixed rate callable certificates of deposit issue with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The 8.364 percent certificates due May 16, 2007, were issued at par. There is a call option at the end of year four.</p>
<p>The deal was self-arranged by ABN Amro Bank's Hong Kong branch.</p>
<p>The payment date is May 16.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
